{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"lua","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Lua","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Lua (.lua).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"lua","name":"Lua","extensions":[".lua"],"grammar":"grammars/lua.json","lineComment":"--","blockComment":["--[[","]]"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Lua","path":"snippets/lua.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/lua.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\-\\\\-\\\\[\\\\[\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\]\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\-\\\\-\\\\[==\\\\[\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\]==\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\-\\\\-.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\[\\\\[\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\]\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:function|elseif|repeat|return|break|local|until|while|else|goto|then|and|end|for|not|do|if|in|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|self|nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:string\\\\.format|setmetatable|getmetatable|table\\\\.insert|table\\\\.remove|table\\\\.concat|string\\\\.sub|tostring|tonumber|require|ipairs|assert|select|unpack|print|pairs|pcall|error|type)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/lua.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"local function ${1:name}(${2:args})\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"For pairs\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"forp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for ${1:k}, ${2:v} in pairs(${3:t}) do\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Iterate a table\"\n  },\n  \"For ipairs\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fori\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for ${1:i}, ${2:v} in ipairs(${3:t}) do\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Iterate an array\"\n  },\n  \"If\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"if\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"if ${1:condition} then\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"if\"\n  },\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"local M = {}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"\",\n      \"return M\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module table\"\n  },\n  \"Require\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"req\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"local ${1:name} = require('${2:module}')\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"require\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Lua\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Lua.\n\n## Files\n\n`.lua`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `--`.\n- 6 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `fn` | A function |\n| `forp` | Iterate a table |\n| `fori` | Iterate an array |\n| `if` | if |\n| `mod` | A module table |\n| `req` | require |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}